85 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 63 0 R
/E (Because the work happens underneath the story. First you tell me what happened \(the argument, the job, the move\). Below it sits something older: how you learned to read yourself, and what you decided that made you. Not inner as in hidden or mystical. Inner as in yours, your inner self, the part of your life only you can describe.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
86 0 obj
<<
