/P 63 0 R
/E (Meaning)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
87 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 63 0 R
/E (Because events don't reach us raw, they arrive already interpreted. Two people lose the same job: one feels a door close, the other hears confirmation of what they always suspected about themselves. The difference isn't the event, but the meaning attached to it, usually set long before, by experiences you were too young to question. Meanings made early can be revisited. That's the whole premise of this work.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
